; MDF cut-through grid: feed (rows) x passes (columns)
; generated by emitter.py
; rows bottom->top: F200/300/400/500/600/800
; columns left->right: passes 1/2/3/4/6/8
; chamfered square = F200 x1; a square that drops out cut through
; run on 1 sheet, then a taped stack of 2 (and 3); repeat per focus block
;
;HEAD: laser
;MATERIAL: mdf_3mm
;LASER_MODE: static  (M3 — dwell-burn-through risk if motion stalls)

$32=1   ; GRBL laser mode
G21     ; mm
G90     ; absolute
M5      ; laser off
G0 X0 Y0

